<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission in surprise move on refunds.</title>
<headline>EU Commission in surprise move on refunds.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission on Thursday asked the European Union's cereals management committee to approve November export refunds for cereals and rice based products and compound animal feed, an EU official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The move took the member states and the trade by surprise. No reason was given for bringing the decision forward from next month,&quot; an EU official said.</p>
<p>The refunds which include non-annex II goods applying from Friday October 25 were fixed as:</p>
<p>    PRODUCT	   PROCESSED	 COMPOUND	  NON-ANNEX</p>
<p>			  PRODUCT	   FEED		II GOODS</p>
<p>    COMMON WHEAT    6.38		6.38		6.38</p>
<p>    DURUM WHEAT     6.28		-		   8.68</p>
<p>    BARLEY	    29.29	     29.29	     29.08</p>
<p>    MAIZE	     36.65	     36.65	     28.89</p>
<p>    RYE		 30.02	     -		   24.10</p>
<p>    OATS		26.86	     -		   20.87</p>
<p>    BROKEN RICE     46.20	     -		   14.38</p>
<p>    ROUND RICE	253.00	    -		   255.00</p>
<p>    LONG GRAIN RICE 253.00	    -		   255.00</p>
<p>ABATED REFUNDS</p>
<p>    POTATO STARCH   36.65	     -		   23.59</p>
<p>    GLUCOSE	   29.09	     -		   23.26</p>
<p>Refunds effective from Friday November 1 were fixed as:</p>
<p>    PRODUCT	   PROCESSED	 COMPOUND	  NON-ANNEX</p>
<p>			  PRODUCT	   FEED		II GOODS</p>
<p>    COMMON WHEAT    6.38		6.38		6.38</p>
<p>    DURUM WHEAT     7.38		-		   7.38</p>
<p>    BARLEY	    30.39	     30.39	     30.39</p>
<p>    MAIZE	     37.75	     37.75	     37.75</p>
<p>    RYE		 31.12	     -		   31.12</p>
<p>    OATS		27.96	     -		   27.96</p>
<p>    BROKEN RICE     46.20	     -		   46.20</p>
<p>    ROUND RICE	253.00	    -		   253.00</p>
<p>    LONG GRAIN RICE 253.00	    -		   253.00</p>
<p>ABATED REFUNDS</p>
<p>    POTATO STARCH   37.75	     -		   37.75</p>
<p>    GLUCOSE	   29.91	     -		   29.91</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
